OL,3,AMiliband says Israeli response to UK
OL,4,Asanctions on West Bank settlements
OL,5,A'deeply regrettable'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK's foreign secretary says
OL,8,FIsrael's response to UK sanctions on
OL,9,FWest Bank settlements is "deeply
OL,10,Fregrettable"
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, Ed Miliband told Parliament
OL,13,Fthe UK would ban the import of goods
OL,14,Ffrom Israeli settlements in the
OL,15,Fillegally occupied West Bank
OL,17,FMiliband also said "settler terrorists"
OL,18,Fwere carrying out "ethnic cleansing" -
OL,19,Faccusing the Israeli government of
OL,20,Fturning a "blind eye"
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
