OL,3,APaul Adams: British-Israeli relations
OL,4,Aat lowest ebb in decades
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's furious response to the
OL,7,FBritish government's decision to ban
OL,8,Ftrade with Israeli settlements in the
OL,9,Foccupied West Bank testifies to just
OL,10,Fhow important this moment is.
OL,12,FBritain took the brunt of Israel's
OL,13,Fanger, but the fact that 12 countries
OL,14,Fchose to move together clearly
OL,15,Fsharpened the sense of outrage.
OL,17,FOfficials in London always knew that
OL,18,Fsuch a dramatic shift in policy towards
OL,19,FIsrael-Palestine was going to elicit a
OL,20,Fhostile response, but seemed taken
OL,21,Faback by the speed and ferocity of
OL,22,FIsrael's reaction.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
