OL,3,AMore flight delays expected after
OL,4,Ahundreds cancelled by air traffic
OL,5,Acontrol glitch
OL,6,
OL,7,FNats boss Martin Rolfe apologised,
OL,8,Ftelling the BBC there would be a full
OL,9,Finvestigation into what had gone wrong,
OL,10,Fafter the firm said resolving the issue
OL,11,Fhad taken "longer than hoped".
OL,13,FThe BBC understands Transport Secretary
OL,14,FHeidi Alexander has summoned Rolfe to a
OL,15,Fmeeting on Wednesday to answer
OL,16,Fquestions about the disruption and
OL,17,Fresponse.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
